					D.S.
					3.67
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. νόμους</span>
			<i>give</i> them <i>a lasting form,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Jud.Voc.</u>
				5
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
