				<u>Wi.</u>
				19.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.11
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.59
			</span></i>; of seals, <i>to be engraved,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				801b5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>imagine, conceive,</i>
			
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῇ φαντασίᾳ</span>
				Chor.<i><span class="en">
				p.213
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				4.3.8
			</span></i>; <i>represent, portray,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.83a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρώμασί τι</span>”
