				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.1.1
			</span></i>; <i>to be arranged, regulated by agreement,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταξὺ τῶν Ἑλλγνίδων πόλεων . .
					ὁπόσα χρὴ ἑκάστην . . λύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.24.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
